                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3e89a487-fc48-3aff-8f3c-02dd5a82b178",
                        "entry_id": "1b4cf0df-fa0b-32c3-8d2f-a72dcfe3456c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "фант. оружие дальнего боя, основанное на неизвестных или недостаточно проработанных в настоящее время физических принципах, или лазерное"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f23a5841-e62e-4fbc-99c7-a885765093a9",
                                "sense_id": "3e89a487-fc48-3aff-8f3c-02dd5a82b178",
                                "text": "Они ушли, а через несколько минут Полосков вернулся бего́м и принёс мне бластер."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0c7960b-734e-47f6-afb7-218daa9a810e",
                                "sense_id": "3e89a487-fc48-3aff-8f3c-02dd5a82b178",
                                "text": "Такой бластер является превосходным оружием для членов команды звездолёта, а будучи установленным на маломощный «ошеломляющий» режим, способен лишить человека сознания на период до 10 минут."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2a9626e0-4f56-3706-9f01-a47437386e31",
                        "entry_id": "1b4cf0df-fa0b-32c3-8d2f-a72dcfe3456c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. аппарат для пескоструйной обработки поверхностей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "36103a7f-227d-408e-b23c-414dbebb31b5",
                                "sense_id": "2a9626e0-4f56-3706-9f01-a47437386e31",
                                "text": "Бластер BL45 обладает улучшенной системой подачи воздуха, благодаря чему уменьшается вибрация и обеспечивается более точная регулировка расхода сухого льда."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c7b1fa9-86e2-4b5b-8ff1-25ad3a495614",
                        "source_entry_id": "1b4cf0df-fa0b-32c3-8d2f-a72dcfe3456c",
                        "source_sense_description": "оружие",
                        "target_lang_word": "blaster",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "blaster",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "230a926b-51d9-3cad-a2e5-2a38e88fe346",
                                        "entry_id": "be7627b6-ab58-306d-bbe0-7f9a27bff6f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that, or anyone who blasts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca655875-c191-435e-a813-a1bebd2a48da",
                                                "sense_id": "230a926b-51d9-3cad-a2e5-2a38e88fe346",
                                                "text": "infrared blaster"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5cf50b3c-51e2-36eb-9f6d-de170b533696",
                                        "entry_id": "be7627b6-ab58-306d-bbe0-7f9a27bff6f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device to detonate an explosive, often consisting of a box with a handle to be pressed down."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c13f1d69-dccc-3dd4-8968-888961d76163",
                                        "entry_id": "be7627b6-ab58-306d-bbe0-7f9a27bff6f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An unspecified powerful hand weapon, usually one that fires an energy pulse or beam."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d38a7fc2-7e3d-41f4-9e78-eded881ca095",
                                                "sense_id": "c13f1d69-dccc-3dd4-8968-888961d76163",
                                                "text": "Blast out the lakes and canals—whittle down the peaks and mounds with atomic blasters—file them into the shape of gigantic buildings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38aaa644-f53a-4468-82e7-fe022250ae3b",
                                                "sense_id": "c13f1d69-dccc-3dd4-8968-888961d76163",
                                                "text": "One slender hand clung near a singular jewel, like a great white snow crystal, that hung from her throat. And the other, with a practiced and familiar grip, held a barytron blaster of the newest legion design. An unwilling little glisten had come into the violet eyes. Her blond head flung angrily. She caught her breath, and lifted the barytron blaster. Its bright tube pointed straight between his shoulders. He would never even know."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72b86b5e-b22f-3a48-857c-9f6a62f9c5e7",
                                        "entry_id": "be7627b6-ab58-306d-bbe0-7f9a27bff6f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sand wedge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a867fd9-17f8-4a6b-9304-9d442c58245a",
                                                "sense_id": "72b86b5e-b22f-3a48-857c-9f6a62f9c5e7",
                                                "text": "The \"blaster\" type of club has been blamed for doing its share in making golf courses look ridiculous, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cf065fb-cc86-4a72-a73e-744fd7cc1cd1",
                                                "sense_id": "72b86b5e-b22f-3a48-857c-9f6a62f9c5e7",
                                                "text": "The person who has a sand wedge - the blaster - for these shots has a distinct advantage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
